{"title": "Leave Ethereal Plane", "pageid": 22181, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Leave_Ethereal_Plane", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp/300px-Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp, /w/images/5/5b/Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp/300px-Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Leave_Ethereal_Plane.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Leave Ethereal Plane</b> is a free action available only while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a>. It lets the caster of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink\" title=\"Blink\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/20px-Blink_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/30px-Blink_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/40px-Blink_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/20px-Blink_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink\" title=\"Blink\">Blink</a> to return to the physical world.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Return to the Material Plane.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Blink_Teleport_Dismiss</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Blink_Teleport_Dismiss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Blink_Teleport_Dismiss\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted by the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a>, which is potentially granted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\">Blink</a> while using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink\" title=\"Blink\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" cla